              Automated spare-parts ordering
              <i aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#pk-chev"/></svg></i>
            </button>
            <div class="qb" id="capb-part"><div>
              <p>Your customer photographs the worn part, iSERV names it and puts it in the basket. Interactive catalogues cover every assembly, so a repeat order takes one tap instead of an email thread.</p>
              <div class="chips">
                <span class="chip">AI image-to-part recognition</span><span class="chip">Interactive visual cataloguing</span><span class="chip">Automated order routing</span>
              </div>
            </div></div>
